  "name": "cosi-book",
  "description": "A comprehensive technical knowledge base for the Clarkson Open Source Institute (COSI) labs, implemented as a version-controlled mdBook. It documents critical infrastructure including network topologies, IP allocations, rack layouts, and physical server specifications, alongside operational configurations for core services like DNS, DHCP, and firewalls. The repository integrates a containerized deployment workflow using Docker and Nginx to serve the documentation as a static site.",
